{"id":"2e22a7c5ff7f6144","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-variety-distributive.md","title":"Congruence Distributive","display":"Congruence Distributive","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-variety-distributive","aliases":["93-cor-variety-distributive"],"display":"Congruence Distributive","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-df-congruence-distributive]]","[[93-lem-distributive-identity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-variety-distributive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-variety-distributive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Congruence Distributive"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e317109be82f65fa\" href=\"?note=e317109be82f65fa\" title=\"93-df-congruence-distributive\">93-df-congruence-distributive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f983e6b98c86a8fa\" href=\"?note=f983e6b98c86a8fa\" title=\"93-lem-distributive-identity\">93-lem-distributive-identity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-variety-distributive---Congruence-Distributive\">cor-variety-distributive - Congruence Distributive</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from the cited definitions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CongDist}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\n\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Congruence distributivity is witnessed uniformly across all congruence lattices in the variety.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-variety-distributive---Congruence-Distributive","text":"cor-variety-distributive - Congruence Distributive","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c